2026-09-27T08:01:25Z authored README.md text='How this works: two-pair sentence replaced by the e2/e4 vs e1/e3 caveat and a note that APOE testing does not predict AD in people without symptoms. Sources table: Genin row states the lifetime risks are modelled and conditional on reaching 85, with CIs and PAQUID 68%; Fortea row adds near-full AD biology. Limits: prediction in people without symptoms; GC-rich, sometimes poorly covered defining sites. Review record added.' (judged; no value from review findings (lay reader and scientific reviewer) to disagree with) by=Anton Kulaga (with Claude) human_reviewed=false [replaced an earlier record]
